{"assignees":[],"author":{"id":"U_kgDOEYEKUw","is_bot":false,"login":"cuentaprueba244w-dotcom","name":""},"body":"**Bounty:** $20 (LT)\n\n\n**Area:** .editorconfig - project formatting\n\n\n**Current state:** No consistent formatting rules across the polyglot codebase.\n\n\n**What's needed:** Create .editorconfig with rules for all languages: Python(4), Rust(4), TS/JS(2), Go(tabs), Makefile(tabs), YAML/JSON/MD(2).\n\n\n**Acceptance criteria:**\n- .editorconfig at repo root with root=true\n- Rules cover all language in repo\n- All rules specify indent_style, indent_size, charset, end_of_line\n\n\n\n**Required validation:**\n- Run `python3 build.py`\n- Include the generated diagnostic `.logd` artifact from `diagnostic/build-XXX.logd` in the PR; also include `diagnostic/build-XXX.json` if present\n- Use `.github/pull_request_template.md` for your submission","comments":[{"id":"IC_kwDOS9iuvM8AAAABGuz7xQ","author":{"login":"Luzijano"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"I’m taking this one now and will submit a scoped PR with the required diagnostics.","createdAt":"2026-06-18T22:40:26Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/cuentaprueba244w-dotcom/zeroeye/issues/2#issuecomment-4746705861","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOS9iuvM8AAAABGybMbQ","author":{"login":"Nexussyn"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Bounty Submission — Runtime Open Federation\n\n**Payment address (USDC on Base):** `0xb438d36b425b504724a1c72aa0941c80cb940995`\nWe can complete this task and deliver within 24h. Please assign to confirm.","createdAt":"2026-06-19T09:55:11Z","includesCreatedEdit":false,"isMinimized":false,"minimizedReason":"","reactionGroups":[],"url":"https://github.com/cuentaprueba244w-dotcom/zeroeye/issues/2#issuecomment-4750494829","viewerDidAuthor":false},{"id":"IC_kwDOS9iuvM8AAAABGywtrw","author":{"login":"Nexussyn"},"authorAssociation":"NONE","body":"## Bounty Submission — Runtime Open Federation\n